    <dashboard name='Information'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#040042' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Checkout Funnel Dashboard</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#040042' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Point of contact: </run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Fintech Data - Payments Analytics (fintech_data_payments@deliveryhero.com)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>Update schedule:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'> Daily</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CheckoutfunneldashboardWIP/Information?rev=' id='Information' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/CheckoutfunneldashboardWIP' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_10' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1400' maxwidth='1200' minheight='1400' minwidth='1200' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98858' id='5' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='571'>
            <zone fixed-size='128' h='9143' id='8' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='571'>
              <zone fixed-size='848' h='9143' id='7' is-fixed='true' type-v2='title' w='71334' x='667' y='571'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='9143' id='9' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DH_Fintech_Full_RGB.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='27332' x='72001' y='571'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone h='89715' id='6' type-v2='layout-basic' w='98666' x='667' y='9714'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='89715' id='10' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='9714'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03005d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>About this dashboard</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14'>Overview:</run>
                  <run>

This dashboard shows information for the checkout front end funnel. This means it shows data since a specific session reaches the checkout page onwards. 

This dashboard is still </run>
                  <run bold='true'>WIP</run>
                  <run>.&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14'>Definitions:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true'>mCVR4:</run>
                  <run> it&apos;s the conversion rate for the checkout, this means successfully paid transactions / checkout loaded sessions. In terms of event actions it&apos;s transaction / checkout_loaded. 

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Last payment method:</run>
                  <run> it&apos;s the last payment method chosen to do a transaction in a specific session. 

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>First payment method:</run>
                  <run> it&apos;s the first payment method chosen to do a transaction in a specific session. The logic is the same as in last payment method, but reversing the order of the chosen payment methods. 

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Payment method default:</run>
                  <run> when available, it&apos;s the payment method that is by default in a specific session. It&apos;s calculated by the event label from the payment method chosen event action. 

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Tokenization checkout:</run>
                  <run> when the payment method is tokenized at first checkout in a specific session. 

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Tokenization payment method selected:</run>
                  <run> when the user saves the used payment method in a specific session.

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Customer type:</run>
                  <run> it can be new or recurring customer. It is calculated based on pd_customer data, considering the date of first transaction for that particular user. 

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Front end funnel:</run>
                  <run> event action considered:
        - checkout.loaded
        - order_payment_method.chosen
        - transaction.clicked
        - transaction.attempted
        - transaction

</run>
                  <run bold='true'>Last transaction failed reasons:</run>
                  <run> when a transaction in a certain sessions fails, we can get different responses for the reasons. That&apos;s why we are using only the last transaction failed reason that was received in a certain session. 
For some cases this was normalized due codes that multiply the number of rows for similar failed reasons. These cases are for:
          - ApiClient.ApiError
          - Error Domain
          - invalid address id
          - invalid metadata
          - invalid voucher validation



</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='14'>Tab contents:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03005d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>Overview:</run>
                  <run>

This tab contains the main information of the dashboard. It starts showing the mCVR4 for a specific date, and it&apos;s variation with the previous day. It also shows mCVR4 evolution. 

The second part of the graphs shows the funnel, for a specific date and the evolution of the funnel mCVR4.


</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03005d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>Failure deep dive:</run>
                  <run>

This tab shows the different failure reasons for specific days. These failures are considering only the last failure received in a session. The first graph shows the top failures for a selected timeframe, and the second shows the evolution by day. 

As there are many different failure reasons that aren&apos;t grouped, in this tab there is a Top N selector to choose how many different failure reasons to visualize. This filter goes from 5 to 100 (though there are more available failures).


</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#03005d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>First and last payment method:</run>
                  <run>

This tab shows the funnel data but comparing the different payment methods. Here we can compare the funnel performance considering the variations in the payment methods that a user used, and where in the funnel they were most affected.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#b4b4b4' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='10' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='10' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
